  "configuration_id": "config_002",
  "reason": "Evidence: RNA-only with PCA n2000 single profile (config_001) achieved 0.485 accuracy, far outperforming image-only ResNet50 (config_010, 0.208), establishing RNA as the dominant modality. Uncertainty: We don't yet know whether multiprofile aggregation can further improve the RNA signal, or whether the single-profile PCA representation is already near its ceiling. This experiment (config_002) tests the minimal extension of the best config by adding multiprofile + avgpool aggregation while keeping the same PCA n2000 encoder, isolating the effect of profile aggregation. It is the best use of experiment 3 because it directly exploits the strongest signal found so far, changes only one design axis (profile/aggregation), and will tell us whether to invest remaining budget in multiprofile variants (transformer aggregation, better encoders) or pivot toward encoder quality and multimodal fusion."
}

